\n\\begin{aligned}y-y_1 &= m(x-x_1) \\\\ y-(-8) &= 2(x-(-2)) \\\\ y-(-8) &= 2 x + 4 \\\\ y &= 2 x -4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, write the equation in standard form with coprime integer coefficients and a positive $x$-coefficient.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y &= 2 x -4 \\\\ 2 x -y &= 4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe first blank is $2 x -y$ and the second blank is $4$." 13194139535227 17592186045443 true] [17592186482668 1080 "-1" 13194139535227 17592186045443 true] [17592186482668 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535227 17592186045443 true] [17592186482668 1083 #uuid "513484e6-7d22-5022-8ecf-85438c0cb103" 13194139535227 17592186045443 true] [17592186482669 1080 "2 x -y" 13194139535227 17592186045443 true] [17592186482669 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535227 17592186045443 true] [17592186482669 1083 #uuid "55afb0bf-08cd-54b1-a958-addd72254d61" 13194139535227 17592186045443 true] [17592186482670 1075 #edb/ref 17592186482699 13194139535227 17592186045443 true] [17592186482670 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 13194139535227 17592186045443 true] [17592186482670 1077 "field-1" 13194139535227 17592186045443 true] [17592186482670 1078 #edb/ref 17592186482699 13194139535227 17592186045443 true] [17592186482670 1079 #uuid "65219644-3796-5358-822b-756937006468" 13194139535227 17592186045443 true] [17592186482671 1080 "4 x + y" 13194139535227 17592186045443 true] [17592186482671 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535227 17592186045443 true] [17592186482671 1083 #uuid "667a48ef-54b2-5010-9318-00444e24a26e" 13194139535227 17592186045443 true] [17592186482672 1075 #edb/ref 17592186482688 13194139535227 17592186045443 true] [17592186482672 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 13194139535227 17592186045443 true] [17592186482672 1077 "field-1" 13194139535227 17592186045443 true] [17592186482672 1078 #edb/ref 17592186482688 13194139535227 17592186045443 true] [17592186482672 1079 #uuid "6f334fab-18b8-5f48-8db5-38821108857f" 13194139535227 17592186045443 true] [17592186482673 1068 #edb/ref 17